{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1519593-what-s-a-fitting-hades-relict","id":1519593,"title":"What's a fitting Hades relict?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-03T04:14:25-07:00","id":1519593,"title":"What's a fitting Hades relict?","content":"Hi, <br /> <br /> I'm playing scion (2.edition) with a group of friends. I need help deciding on a relict. She is the scion of hades and the relict should be an old drachma, a gift from her father, given during visitation. I'm not sure what would be fitting as &quot;powers/percs&quot; for that relict. <br /> It should be a hades-fitting gift for one of his children. Nothing individual for one specifoc character, just Something Hades ould think is helpful. <br /> It would be great if it is nothing for defense, my character already has a creature for that kind of purpose.<br /> <br /> Thank you, looking Forward for Inspiration \ud83d\ude42<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28136-mary-muetze","name":"Mary-Muetze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28136_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-03T04:38:39-07:00","id":1519604,"title":"","content":"Honestly the first thing that comes to mind upon reading &quot;hades-fitting&quot; and &quot;drachma&quot; is <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charon\" target=\"_blank\">the boatman</a> giving you free passage, maybe to places outside the Underworld too as long as they touch on a river or body of water. Alternately, the ability to call or command one of the restless dead, by producing a replica of the drachma to &quot;cover their dues&quot; with Charon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-03T06:34:03-07:00","id":1519624,"title":"","content":"Could be access to the Prosperity Purview. Motif: Hades holds dominion over all the precious things mined below, and owning one coin from his hand is wealth to meet any price.<br /> <br /> Could be access to the Death Purview. Motif: Your passage has been symbolically paid, and the living and dead may cross paths by your authority.<br /> <br /> If you have Realms of Magic and Mystery, it could have a Knack with equivalent effects to the Psychopomp's The Longest Road, allowing you to cross into one of the Underworlds by marking a doorway, or a version of the Traveler's Guide keyed specifically to the Underworlds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-05T09:32:56-07:00","id":1519870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1519593-what-s-a-fitting-hades-relict?p=1519624#post1519624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you have Realms of Magic and Mystery, it could have a Knack with equivalent effects to the Psychopomp's The Longest Road, allowing you to cross into one of the Underworlds by marking a doorway, or a version of the Traveler's Guide keyed specifically to the Underworlds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, that was a great advice. I asked my storyteller/gm and she has this book. Wie found some great psychpomp knacks for my drachma. We both are thrilled.<br /> <br /> Thank you!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28136-mary-muetze","name":"Mary-Muetze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28136_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-05T09:38:36-07:00","id":1519872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1519593-what-s-a-fitting-hades-relict?p=1519604#post1519604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly the first thing that comes to mind upon reading &quot;hades-fitting&quot; and &quot;drachma&quot; is <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charon\" target=\"_blank\">the boatman</a> giving you free passage, maybe to places outside the Underworld too as long as they touch on a river or body of water. Alternately, the ability to call or command one of the restless dead, by producing a replica of the drachma to &quot;cover their dues&quot; with Charon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also a cool idea. We established that a scion of hades does not need to pay to cross the styx because they are kind of part of the underworld. But the idea to 'cover theis dues' ist interesting because my character feels sorry for the souls waiting on the styx riverside without money for charon. <br /> <br /> Thank you !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28136-mary-muetze","name":"Mary-Muetze","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28136_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}